      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "formData": {
          "textContent": [
            {
              "type": "title",
              "value": "⬆️⬆️ 55% Auto Rebate ⬆️⬆️"
            },
            {
              "type": "sub_title",
              "value": "Join us for our 55% Auto Rebate, meet other hosts, and get yourself rewarded.⚡\n\n❗️⚠️Attention⚠️❗️\nPlease note that the highest-level reward tiers in this event will be adjusted from auto distribution to manual distribution.\n\nLv.6 will now be manually issued after verification❗️❗️❗️\n\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "📅 Event run dates: 12/05-12/09; 12/13-12/16; 12/20-12/23; 12/27-12/31"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "⏰ Event run time: 4:00 PM - 6:00 PM PST.\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "sub_title",
              "value": "🟡 Rewards Structure "
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "12/5-12/9; 12/13-12/16\nlv.1 - if 10,000 beans received, get 5,500 beans reward\nlv.2 - if 20,000 beans received, get extra 5,500 beans reward\nlv.3 - if 30,000 beans received, get extra 5,500 beans reward\nlv.4 - if 50,000 beans received, get extra 11,000 beans reward\nlv.5 - if 70,000 beans received, get extra 11,000 beans reward\nThe maximum reward you can receive is 38,500 beans reward\n\n12/20-12/23; 12/27-12/31\n❗️❗️Lv.6 will now be manually issued after verification❗️❗️\nlv.1 - if 10,000 beans received, get 5,500 beans reward\nlv.2 - if 20,000 beans received, get extra 5,500 beans reward\nlv.3 - if 30,000 beans received, get extra 5,500 beans reward\nlv.4 - if 50,000 beans received, get extra 11,000 beans reward\nlv.5 - if 70,000 beans received, get extra 11,000 beans reward\nlv.6 - if 90,000 beans received, get extra 11,000 beans reward【will be launched manually】\nThe maximum reward you can receive is 49,500 beans reward"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Go live in Solo or Multiguest Room at least 20 mins within the hour, you can do PK and different livestreaming formats you like!\n\nCompleting Box and Auto Reward events at the same time: rewards from auto reward events that have already been issued will be deducted from Box Event rewards."
            }
          ]
        },
